    "body": "Chrome does the same as safari.\r\n\r\nToo late in the day for spinning up VMs, will try edge later.\r\n\r\nTestcase: `<iframe src=\"data:text/html,<body topmargin=100px>text</body>\" marginheight=0></iframe>`",
